<section class="lp-card"><div class="lp-section"><div><h2>Profit & loss · Schedule C workpaper</h2><p>Cash-basis classified bank activity. Transfers and equity are excluded. Review category mappings, inventory/COGS, depreciation and other adjustments before preparing a return.</p></div><%= form_with url: dashboard_accounting_path,method: :get do |f| %><%= hidden_field_tag :employer_id,@employer.id %><%= hidden_field_tag :book_id,@book.id %><%= hidden_field_tag :tab,'reports' %><%= f.number_field :year,value: @year,min: 2000,max: 2100,aria: {label: 'Reporting year'} %><%= f.select :month, Date::MONTHNAMES.each_with_index.filter_map { |name,i| [name,i] if name }, {include_blank: 'Annual',selected: @month}, aria: {label: 'Reporting month'} %><%= f.submit 'View report',class: 'lp-button secondary' %><% end %></div><div class="lp-departments"><article><h3>Income</h3><strong><%= accounting_money(@report['income_cents']) %></strong></article><article><h3>Expenses</h3><strong><%= accounting_money(@report['expense_cents']) %></strong></article><article><h3>Net profit</h3><strong><%= accounting_money(@report['profit_cents']) %></strong></article><article><h3>Uncategorized</h3><strong><%= @report['uncategorized_count'] %></strong></article></div><div class="lp-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Schedule C mapping</th><th>Book amount</th><th>Tax workpaper amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @report['groups'].each do |group| %><tr><td><%= group['name'] %></td><td><%= group['schedule_code'].presence || 'Review required' %></td><td><%= accounting_money(group['actual_cents']) %></td><td><%= accounting_money(group['tax_cents']) %></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th>Month</th><th>Income</th><th>Expenses</th><th>Profit</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @report['months'].sort.each do |month,values| %><tr><td><%= month %></td><td><%= accounting_money(values['income_cents']) %></td><td><%= accounting_money(values['expense_cents']) %></td><td><%= accounting_money(values['income_cents']-values['expense_cents']) %></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="lp-card"><h2>2026 federal tax reserve estimate</h2><p>Published 1040-ES ordinary-income rate schedules and self-employment tax calculations. This projection is a reserve worksheet; it does not submit a return or pay tax. Use reviewed annual projections and aggregate the owner’s relevant income. Capital gains, AMT, QBI eligibility, state taxes and multi-person SE calculations need separate reviewed inputs.</p><%= form_with url: dashboard_accounting_tax_path(employer_id: @employer.id,book_id: @book.id),scope: :tax,class: 'lp-form' do |f| %><%= render 'tax_inputs',f: f %><label class="lp-check"><%= check_box_tag :tax_reviewed,'1',false,required: true %> I reviewed the scope, annual income, deductions, credits and applicable tax-year rules.</label><%= f.submit 'Calculate reserve worksheet',class: 'lp-button' %><% end %><% if @estimate %><%= render 'tax_result',result: @estimate %><% end %></section>
<section class="lp-card"><h2>Scheduled accounting workers</h2><p>Refresh reports or tax reserves from categorized book activity. Workers recheck membership, accounting access and authenticator enrollment. This scheduling does not approve payroll, release money or transmit tax returns.</p><% if @can_admin %><%= form_with url: dashboard_accounting_automations_path(employer_id: @employer.id,book_id: @book.id),class: 'lp-form' do |f| %><div class="lp-grid"><label>Task<%= f.select :action_kind,[['Refresh financial reports','reports'],['Refresh tax reserve from book activity','tax_reserve']] %></label><label>Frequency<%= f.select :cadence,[['Daily','daily'],['Weekly','weekly']] %></label></div><details><summary>Tax reserve worker inputs</summary><%= fields_for :tax do |tax_form| %><%= render 'tax_inputs',f: tax_form %><% end %><label class="lp-check"><%= check_box_tag :tax_reviewed,'1',false %> I reviewed these inputs; the worker substitutes the current classified book profit without annualizing it.</label></details><%= f.submit 'Schedule worker',class: 'lp-button secondary' %><% end %><% end %><% @automations.each do |worker| %><article class="lp-election"><div><strong><%= worker.data['action'].humanize %></strong><p><%= worker.enabled? ? 'Enabled' : 'Stopped' %> · Next <%= worker.next_run_at %> · <%= worker.error_code %></p><% if worker.data['latest'] %><p>Last calculation: <%= worker.data['latest']['calculated_at'] %></p><% if worker.data['latest']['tax_estimate'] %><%= render 'tax_result',result: worker.data['latest']['tax_estimate'] %><% end %><% end %></div><%= button_to 'Stop worker',dashboard_accounting_automation_path(worker,employer_id: @employer.id,book_id: @book.id),method: :delete,class: 'lp-button secondary' if @can_admin && worker.enabled? %></article><% end %></section>
<section class="lp-card"><h2>IRS connection activation</h2><p>Individual return filing uses IRS Modernized e-File; information returns use IRIS. The relevant enrollment, provider credentials, software/transmitter testing and taxpayer authorization are required before a transmission adapter can be activated. Calculation and worker scheduling are available here; IRS transmission is not activated in this release.</p><%= link_to 'IRS API enrollment requirements ↗','https://www.irs.gov/tax-professionals/get-an-api-client-id',rel: 'noopener',class: 'lp-button secondary' %></section>
